      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLIP FLOP (6) has a strong record here with three wins and three placings from seven starts. Was out of placings last time (24.24) at Casino in a Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 14 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. REDEEM A ARCADIA (2) scored by 1.5 lengths last time (17.42) in a Grade 3/4 over 300m at this track. Looks one of the chances. LITTLE BEAST (8) recorded a 3.5 lengths second in a Grade 5 last time 17.76 at this track and trip and also jumping from the same draw. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Harder here but expected to measure up. KAEO (1) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
